{"title": "尼采哲学经典（套装共5册）", "index": 71, "content": [{"type": "html", "value": "<body class=\"calibre\">\n<p class=\"calibre4\" style=\"margin:0pt; border:0pt; height:1em\"> </p><table class=\"calibre_17\" valign=\"top\"><tr class=\"calibre_18\" valign=\"top\"><td class=\"calibre_19\"><img class=\"calibre_23\" src=\"images/00112.jpg\"/> </td><td class=\"calibre_19\"><img class=\"calibre_49\" src=\"images/00021.jpg\"/> </td></tr><tr class=\"calibre_18\" valign=\"top\"><td class=\"calibre_19\"><span class=\"calibre3\">   </span><span class=\"calibre3\"><span class=\"bold\">1871年10月中旬，从左至右：好友欧文·罗德、卡尔·冯·格尔斯多夫和弗里德里希·尼采  </span></span><span class=\"calibre3\">\n</span>\n</td><td class=\"calibre_19\"><span class=\"calibre3\">   </span><span class=\"calibre3\"><span class=\"bold\">就读普福塔高等学校时的尼采（1861年）  </span></span><span class=\"calibre3\">\n</span>\n</td></tr></table><p class=\"calibre4\" style=\"margin:0pt; border:0pt; height:1em\"> </p><table class=\"calibre_17\" valign=\"top\"><tr class=\"calibre_18\" valign=\"top\"><td class=\"calibre_19\"><img class=\"calibre_50\" src=\"images/00068.jpg\"/> </td><td class=\"calibre_19\"><img class=\"calibre_49\" src=\"images/00070.jpg\"/> </td></tr><tr class=\"calibre_18\" valign=\"top\"><td class=\"calibre_19\"><span class=\"calibre3\">   </span><span class=\"calibre3\"><span class=\"bold\">任教巴塞尔大学的尼采  </span></span><span class=\"calibre3\">\n</span>\n</td><td class=\"calibre_19\"><span class=\"calibre3\">   </span><span class=\"calibre3\"><span class=\"bold\">青年时代的尼采  </span></span><span class=\"calibre3\">\n</span>\n</td></tr></table><p class=\"calibre_2\"><img class=\"calibre_45\" src=\"images/00003.jpg\"/>\n</p><p class=\"calibre_11\"><span class=\"calibre3\"><span class=\"bold\">魏玛的尼采档案馆</span></span></p><div class=\"mbp_pagebreak\" id=\"calibre_pb_70\"></div>\n</body>"}]}